    "description": "An Etruscan settlement covering some 17 ha located near the modern village of Gonfienti (Prato).",
    "details": "<p>Gonfienti is located between the Bisenzio river, the Marinella stream, and the Calvana mountian range. It lies at the margins of the Florence-Prato-Pistoia lacustrine basin. Excavations were carried out in 1996 and 1997.</p>",
